  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/223730">Remark <span data-tag="223730">5.2.7.9</span>.</a>subcategory!reflectivereflective subcategory By analogy with classical category theory, we will say that a full subcategory $\calC ^0$ of an $\infty $-category $\calC $ is a <em>reflective subcategory</em> if the hypotheses of Proposition <a href="/tag/A4E3E0" data-tag="A4E3E0">5.2.7.8</a> are satisfied by the inclusion $\calC ^0 \subseteq \calC $. </p>
